Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there we were,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在沙漠里艰难行军\N{\fnArial\fs30}scraping our sacks in the sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙丘之上的活靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open targets in the dunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在流汗咒骂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us sweating and swearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总比坐在方圆三十公里内荒无人烟的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure as hell beat sitting on our asses 30 clicks to nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待有驼峰的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for our humpbacked friend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉出车钥匙要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}to defecate the keys to our transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骆驼不吃钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camels don't eat keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃的  它吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且拉出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it shit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shit you not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没否认过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never denied it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美好新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是一直在想玛姬怀孕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still can't stop thinking about Maggie having a pup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.95,0:00:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么坏事都有可能发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.63,0:01:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经说我是傻瓜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You already called me an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.62,0:01:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.41,0:01:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.49,0:01:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:30.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要重新排班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting a new shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.28,0:01:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴格里那边的岗哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The watch post on baggarly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.62,0:01:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和尤金谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I already talked to Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.31,0:01:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想帮更多的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to help out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他会代替我跟你巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he'd take over my patrol with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.70,0:01:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.53,0:01:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:01:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头见  亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.97,0:02:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道尤金要开始巡逻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Eugene's gonna start patrolling?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我教他怎么拆自动手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to teach him how to fieldstrip automatics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要教我化学\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna teach me chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,化学没法教\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't teach chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet flaming mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just... beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.38,0:03:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是油罐车上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from the fuel truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打碎了一个刹车灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to crack a brake light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.24,0:03:47.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你的脖子看起来有些孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought your neck looked a little lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔·埃斯皮诺萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita Espinosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太完美了  知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are damn near perfection, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴上给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搭好棚架  就能垂直种植了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get the trellises in, we can start going vertically.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每平方英尺的西红柿产量能翻番\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double our yield of tomatoes per square foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,定量配给撑不了太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only keep stretching our rations so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没看见一颗小芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still haven't seen a single bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会长出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在我们家里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing in our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:38.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坐在台阶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh, sitting on the steps
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着这幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking at this painting,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着你爸妈穿好衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for your mom and dad to get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, hey, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's-- it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.54,0:06:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说了我们该谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said we should talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:07.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么逃出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个守卫看不住两个出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}One guard can't cover two exits
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者三楼的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}or third floor windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开绳结  撬开锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knots untie and locks get picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-熵来源于秩序  对吧  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Entropy comes from order, right? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:20.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查看了你们的武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked out your arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久没有见过这么多武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen anything like that in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们装备精良  但是食物不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're well-equipped, but your provisions are low.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.79,0:06:29.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不够你们这么多人吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very low for the amount of people you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-54个吗  -更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 54? - More than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饼干很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I appreciate the cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.09,0:06:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨师手艺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}My compliments to the chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.32,0:06:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开局不顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we got off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们是站在同一边的  生存的那一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're on the same side-- the living side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和瑞克完全可以丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Rick had every reason to leave me out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:53.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自的地方和这里很像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from a place that's a lot like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作之一就是寻找其他可以做交易的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of my job is searching out other settlements to trade with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开走了你们的车  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I took your truck because
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我的社区需要东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}my community needs things,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.48,0:07:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你俩看起来都不像好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and both of you looked like trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.39,0:07:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a good place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们两边可以互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think our communities may be in a position to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有食物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have food?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们饲养牲畜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've started to raise livestock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找补给  种地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We scavenge, we grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.74,0:07:24.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从西红柿到高粱应有尽有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything from tomatoes to sorghum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:26.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们为什么要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us why we should believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以带你们去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.96,0:07:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们开车  一天内就能回我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we take a car, I can take you back home in a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以自己看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can all see for yourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是什么人  可以提供什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who we are and what we have to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你在寻找更多营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're looking for more settlements.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是你们已经和别的团体交易了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you're already trading with other groups?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的世界即将变得更广阔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world's about to get a whole lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.97,0:08:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给  自制的燕麦蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homemade oat cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复合碳水化合物  含有欧米伽3脂肪酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complex carbohydrates, omega-3s.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.53,0:08:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们路上要停车  到时候我再找吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make a pit stop. I'll pick up something then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.55,0:08:45.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想染上狂犬病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like rabies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:50.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为我想给你弄到汽水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this 'cause I tried to get you that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.91,0:08:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你让我想到了我以前认识的某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you remind me of someone I used to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望要比看起来好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it tastes better than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为看起来跟屎一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it looks like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屎也比路上的死动物要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit's still better than roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  也许  吃了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe-- just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果他说的是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he's telling the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可能是新生活的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}this could be the start of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算跟你说我和米琼恩的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I was gonna tell you about me and Michonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这事刚发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.75,0:09:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事刚发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is-- this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿上你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开时加百利能照顾朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel can take care of Judith while we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.53,0:09:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得有人留在家里  保护这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's gotta stay back, keep this place safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正一个毁了容的小孩八成也不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid with a messed-up face probably wouldn't make
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给人留下多好的第一印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best first impression anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's chew up some asphalt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.03,0:11:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你倒松饼粉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were, uh, pouring the bisquick,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想做松饼吗(暗示怀孕)\N{\fnArial\fs30}were you trying to make pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.04,0:11:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.38,0:11:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前谈论过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something that we talked about, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -为什么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  我只是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.98,0:11:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种朝不保夕的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, given the precarious state of affairs on any given Sunday,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈真的是被你们这些有胆量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am damn near floored that you or anyone else
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出这种决定的人吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have the cojones to make a call like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试图营造一些东西  我和她\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're trying to build something, me and her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.36,0:12:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一旦看到要下雨  就会穿胶鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see rain coming, I'm wearing galoshes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.23,0:12:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我穿两双\N{\fnArial\fs30}I double up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Rick. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面出车祸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a crash ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着像是刚刚发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.15,0:12:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如这是个陷阱  你不会有好下场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is a trick, it won't end well for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人遇到麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不...  我们之中没有多少战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't-- we don't have a lot of fighters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:17.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这看起来有诈  但我会乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it looks, but I'll play it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能借我一把枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.48,0:13:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.33,0:13:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got tracks right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.09,0:13:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定是在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gotta be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是进去还是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We moving in or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么知道这会不会是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know this ain't firecrackers in a trash can?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.78,0:13:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把你的人救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我们中的一个留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying here with one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你留下好吗  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you stay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去吧  千万小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all go. Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会很小心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一吹口哨  你就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me whistle, shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  我们不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out. We're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是耶稣的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're friends of Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来救你们出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to get you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There more of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两个  他们跑到前面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more. They ran ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是耶稣的朋友  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with Jesus. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能和你们走  我在找我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go with you. I'm looking for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在附近  还在车祸中受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's close, and he's hurt from the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  伙计  我们撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.21,0:15:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-扶住了吗  -走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got him? - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.88,0:16:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说句  我叫哈兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Harlan, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我丈夫  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my husband, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正要把药品带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bringing back medication,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.34,0:16:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你救下的人可能不止我们  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you may have saved more people than just us back there, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:19.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那里有孕期维生素吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any prenatal vitamins in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前是妇产科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, I was an obstetrician before,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:38.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我绝对欠你们人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I most definitely owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我会说你们俩中了头彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'd say you two just hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  弗莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Freddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a second back there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我以为他就要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}just when I thought he was gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变之前她就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She died before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正当我以为我死定了的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just when I thought it was over,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.48,0:17:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}there she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是刚下过暴风雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}A storm must've passed through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.37,0:17:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想逼我们停吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna make us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.91,0:18:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣  这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:18:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开  卡奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗莱迪受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddie's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我为他们道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, sorry about these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一整天站在那里无所事事  有点焦躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get antsy standing up there all day doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们必须交出武器  然后我们才会开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They give up the weapons. Then we'll open the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.46,0:19:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛不下来自己拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come down here and get 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们  我们为这些人担保  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, look, we vouch for these people, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saved us out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别举着矛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower the spears.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我可不想冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not taking any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还是让那位格雷戈里出来吧  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell your guy Gregory to come out here.- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没看到刚发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意你们保留武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm letting you keep your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  几个月前我们就没有弹药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we ran out of ammo months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挺喜欢你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也请相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门  卡奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gates, Cal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时可以来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come see me whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就在医疗拖车里  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just over here in the medical trailer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.83,0:20:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这曾是附近一家电力公司的材料场\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a materials yard for a power company nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才能建起高墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we put up the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都是从应急营地来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people came from a FEMA camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带来了拖车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trailers came with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们是怎么找到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did people find out about this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.17,0:21:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方叫巴林顿公馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's called Barrington House.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三十年代  这家的主人把它捐给了州里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family that owned it gave it to the state in the '30s.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:19.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,州里又把它改造成了生活史博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state turned it into a Living History Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.12,0:21:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十英里内的所有小学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every elementary school for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.02,0:21:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都让学生来这里参观过\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 miles used to come here for field trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现代社会建立之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place was running a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它就已经运转了很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the modern world built up around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想人们之所以会来  是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think people came here because
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想着现代社会毁灭之后它仍会继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}they figured it'd keep running after the modern world broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:37.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以从那些窗户看到数英里之外的各个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those windows up there let us see for miles in every direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能保证安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect for security.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  我带你们看看里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'll show you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gracious, Ignatius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.63,0:22:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多数房间已经被改造成起居室了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the rooms have been converted to living spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连曾经不是卧房的也改了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the ones that weren't bedrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.55,0:22:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们住在这里和拖车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}People live here and the trailers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还计划多建些房屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We plan to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.84,0:22:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有孩子在这里出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's babies being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带了客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:33.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位  这位是格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, this is Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.29,0:22:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让这里正常运转\N{\fnArial\fs30}He keeps the trains running on time around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫瑞克  我们有个社区...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm Rick. We have a community...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为何不去清理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't y'all go get cleaned up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.64,0:22:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣会带你们去洗澡的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus will show you where you can get washed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞干净了再下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then come back down here when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方不容易保洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to keep this place clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.33,0:23:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先洗  你跟他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You clean up first. You talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.87,0:23:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.62,0:23:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也要开始和人谈判了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you gotta start doing these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得瑞克和米琼恩搞在一起多长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think Rick and Michonne been ugging bumplies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.93,0:23:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.50,0:23:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.31,0:24:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安定下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settling down?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得有可能安定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think shit's settled?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.26,0:24:27.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-娜塔莉是吗  -是玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Natalie, right? - Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.59,0:24:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.29,0:24:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一说一  我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She calls them like she sees them. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:36.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进  我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, let's chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.51,0:24:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.53,0:24:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前来过这里一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I came to this place once before,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.86,0:24:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时还是个博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it was a museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.79,0:24:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为商会的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}this, um, Chamber of Commerce thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:24:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这幅画\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love that painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:25:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没想过会是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never figured it'd be mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像它一直在等着我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like it was waiting for me the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.99,0:25:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣告诉我  你们救了卡森医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus told me your group saved Dr. Carson.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然现如今医生是稀缺资源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, a doctor's a rare commodity today,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.69,0:25:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以感谢你们带他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I want to thank you for bringing ours back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.46,0:25:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我丈夫救了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.54,0:25:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也同样感谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be sure to thank him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.97,0:25:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拥有的这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, what you have here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一开始就这样吗  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- has been here since the start? -That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们是怎么活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how-- how is it-- how have you survived here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.84,0:25:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像这样  只能说我擅长此道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at how. I'm good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.10,0:25:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我不拘泥于细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't get hung up on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们住的地方和山顶寨一样好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you live, is it as nice as the Hilltop Colony?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.87,0:25:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just different.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.89,0:25:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么保证食物供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feed everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.35,0:25:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说你们有菜园  但没有庄稼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said you had land for gardens, but no crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.71,0:25:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们才开始种植\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just started planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.23,0:25:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-种什么  -黄瓜  西红柿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Planting what? - Cucumbers, tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,庄稼指的是大豆  玉米  麻类  高粱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crops-- soy, corn, hemp, sorghum.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们种蔬果  -但你们有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Garden stuff. - But you have guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.96,0:26:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你们有不少武器库存\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I assume you have a decent weapons cache.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.64,0:26:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.19,0:26:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们的医务室  医疗用品充足吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your infirmary, is it stocked?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.05,0:26:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的充足吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来谈交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came here hoping to talk trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.20,0:26:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有足够的资源吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have enough here for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.51,0:26:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到我有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到我建立了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what I've built.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.16,0:26:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说你们的食物状况不容乐观\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said that your food situation was challenged right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.89,0:26:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果人们吃不饱  一切就会崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't keep people fed, it comes apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别绕弯子了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's speak the common tongue here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.33,0:26:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.12,0:26:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意帮忙  我是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm happy to help. I'm a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.37,0:26:46.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不能白给\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't just give things away for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.67,0:26:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.56,0:26:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你们没什么物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you can't offer much,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.94,0:26:54.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就让你们的人在这里用劳动交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let your people work here for their share.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个社区很欢迎你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be a welcome addition to the community,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:26:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位聪明美丽的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}a smart and beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.66,0:27:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting back to that common tongue,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你  我会让你觉得物超所值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can tell ya, I can make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.32,0:27:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-给我打住  -听着  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me stop you right there. - Listen, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.51,0:27:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫我亲爱的来骚扰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop coming on to me with calling me honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.42,0:27:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一点弹药都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.47,0:27:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.37,0:27:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们药物不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're low on medication.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.78,0:27:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们双方都有需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need things. We need things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.35,0:27:22.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们要给我们一瓶阿司匹林和一盒子弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you gonna give us a bottle of aspirin and a box of bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.13,0:27:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们两个社区能互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our communities can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  娜塔莉  谈得很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Natalie. Been a good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.71,0:27:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.58,0:27:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在过得挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.85,0:27:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要交易  格雷戈里想要交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to generate trade. Gregory does.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是子弹不是我们迫切所需的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ammo isn't something we urgently need.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.86,0:27:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -墙还能撑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, how's that? - The walls hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.96,0:27:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚带回来了更多药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just brought in more medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.93,0:28:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里想要最好的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory wants the best deal possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.56,0:28:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, we want things, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大老远来  必须拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came all this way, we're gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.63,0:28:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will talk to him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.93,0:28:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能解决的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circumstances change.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.92,0:28:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在过得不错  你们以后也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing well now, and you will next.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.27,0:28:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让他理解这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make him understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.48,0:28:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能再给我几天时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give me a few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.47,0:28:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.58,0:28:49.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.96,0:28:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.46,0:29:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内森  其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan, what happened to everybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.89,0:29:09.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒂姆和玛莎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Tim and Marsha?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.32,0:29:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-尼根干的吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Negan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.31,0:29:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们有约在先的  -他说那不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had a deal. - He said it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.07,0:29:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贡品少了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the drop light?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.99,0:29:23.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克雷格还在他们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still have Craig.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.94,0:29:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说会留他一命  把他还给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they'd keep him alive, return him to us,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.58,0:29:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我给你带个信\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I deliver a message to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.78,0:29:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.70,0:29:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.89,0:29:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me! I had to!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为现在这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the way things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.69,0:30:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.68,0:30:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后  谁拦着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back! Anybody who tries to stop me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.01,0:30:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是想害死我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}is killing my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.81,0:30:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.49,0:30:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内森  你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan! You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想杀格雷戈里  然后杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to kill Gregory, then me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.38,0:31:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.61,0:31:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.94,0:31:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家听着  都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, this is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.35,0:31:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.95,0:31:15.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内森是我们的朋友  但别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan was our friend, but let's not pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是想袭击我们的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was anything more than a coward who attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.74,0:31:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他起的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.29,0:31:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这些人制止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these people stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.55,0:31:32.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.66,0:31:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪拿开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.39,0:31:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做的够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.07,0:31:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to know
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.96,0:31:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情没你想象的那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}that things aren't as simple as they might seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.61,0:31:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.14,0:32:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.77,0:32:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.03,0:32:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better than all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.46,0:32:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森医生帮格雷戈里包扎了伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Carson was able to patch Gregory up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在很痛苦  但还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in pain, but he'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.42,0:32:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.36,0:32:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种事很少在这里发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things like that don't usually happen here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.62,0:32:42.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是已经解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, uh, it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.91,0:32:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到了尼根的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard the name Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.60,0:32:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前达里尔和亚伯拉罕跟他的人起过冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}A while back, Daryl and Abraham had a run-in with his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.98,0:32:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.29,0:32:54.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根领导着一群他所谓的救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan's the head of a group of people he calls the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.36,0:32:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙造好以后  救世军就出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the walls were built, the Saviors showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.91,0:33:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们代表他们的老大见了格雷戈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They met with Gregory on behalf of their boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们提出了很多要求  做出了更多威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made a lot of demands, even more threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我们其中一员  罗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he killed one of us-- Rory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他才16岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was 16 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.46,0:33:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们当着我们的面  把他活活打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They beat him to death right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.75,0:33:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说我们必须明白局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said we needed to understand, right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.23,0:33:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里不是很擅长处理冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory's not exactly good at confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.26,0:33:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是我心中的领导人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not the leader I would've chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.94,0:33:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他帮我们创建了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he helped make this place what it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.79,0:33:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都很喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the people like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.36,0:33:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他接受了条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.01,0:33:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.23,0:33:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的补给  我们的作物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our supplies, our crops,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的牲畜  一半都给救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}our livestock, it goes to the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.67,0:33:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能得到什么作为交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you get in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.24,0:33:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会攻击这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't attack this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.17,0:33:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不会杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.89,0:33:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not just kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.70,0:33:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿大多数人都不知道怎么战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the people here don't even know how to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.15,0:33:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我们有弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if we had ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.61,0:33:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根手下有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how many people does Negan have?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:33:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:33:59.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们最多见过二十个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen groups as big as 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.01,0:34:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他们就这么出现  杀了一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hold up. So, they show up, they kill a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.95,0:34:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就乖乖奉上一半物资吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you give them half of everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.76,0:34:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这群混蛋只是在编故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dicks just got a good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.55,0:34:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓小孩的  他没什么了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bogeyman, he ain't shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.34,0:34:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.70,0:34:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个月前  我们轻松干掉了他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A month ago, we took his guys out PDQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.09,0:34:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们打得七零八落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left them in pieces and puddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.70,0:34:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.00,0:34:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们救回你的人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go get your man back,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.53,0:34:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死尼根  干掉他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill Negan, take out his boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.67,0:34:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you hook us up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.26,0:34:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要食物  药品  和一头奶牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want food, medicine, and one of them cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.15,0:34:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从来不怕处理冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confrontation's never been something we've had trouble with.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.99,0:34:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会告诉格雷戈里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it to Gregory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.31,0:34:52.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有食物  我们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have food, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.10,0:34:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have enough of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.95,0:34:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.75,0:35:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们能做到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.22,0:35:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.49,0:35:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna cost us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.31,0:35:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格雷戈里起来了  他想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gregory's up. He wants to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.75,0:35:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.13,0:35:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想和玛姬谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to talk to Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.29,0:35:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜对你的看法没有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna was right about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.33,0:35:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事先先向你道个歉  格雷戈里有时很混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry in advance. Gregory can be a real prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.27,0:35:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.49,0:35:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉房间里很暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry for the gloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.84,0:35:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们给我注射了抗生素\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have me on these antibiotics
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.77,0:35:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我对光线很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}that make me sensitive to the sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.64,0:36:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是太痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有人在用水泥搅拌机搅我的肠胃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like somebody's twisting my intestines with a cement mixer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.35,0:36:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本可能会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.32,0:36:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.00,0:36:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣跟你说了我们的条件吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus told you about our offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.93,0:36:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.00,0:36:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们凭什么认为能做到我们做不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you can do what we haven't done?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.13,0:36:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对付过尼根这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've handled people like Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.92,0:36:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么对付  -他们已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.30,0:36:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能救回你们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get your man back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.42,0:36:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不知道克雷格值不值得这样大费周折\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if Craig's worth the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.07,0:36:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟这是他兄弟做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's his brother who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.19,0:36:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是为了救他所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was fighting to save someone he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.19,0:36:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.62,0:36:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那令他软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes him weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.02,0:36:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我不知道我是否想让他回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, I don't know if I want him back in our gene pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸曾告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad used to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.04,0:36:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原谅比愤怒更需要勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}forgiveness takes more strength than anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.65,0:36:50.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个很好的厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a hell of a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.27,0:36:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做的青西红柿烤蛋非常好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes these amazing baked eggs with green tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.47,0:36:57.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我们物资  我们去救克雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give us supplies, we'll save Craig
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.02,0:37:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灭掉尼根和救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take care of Negan and the Saviors, permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.39,0:37:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我觉得这段对话很可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I find this whole conversation pretty funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.75,0:37:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我提出让你们劳动换物资时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you balked when I proposed
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你犹豫了  但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your people work for our supplies, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.76,0:37:12.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果不是完全一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't that exactly what's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.45,0:37:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有筹码  我利用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I had leverage and I used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.14,0:37:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  这不是针对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It wasn't personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.39,0:37:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.58,0:37:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要食物  你们有食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need food. You have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们愿意用劳动交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're willing to work for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.16,0:37:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我会给你们的人准备物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll get supplies for your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.19,0:37:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.54,0:37:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会跟耶稣谈谈  做好安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to Jesus and he'll make the arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.31,0:37:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  这挺有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.37,0:37:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令人激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.18,0:37:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.45,0:37:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.40,0:37:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部的一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.27,0:37:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到在外面发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw what happened out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.16,0:37:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根想要这里进贡更多物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan's expecting more supplies from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:38:00.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且会越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.72,0:38:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it keeps going like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很快会一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretty soon you won't have anything left.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.15,0:38:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens then?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.46,0:38:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有弹药  没有战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without ammo, without fighters...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.24,0:38:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.83,0:38:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要你们一半的物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}So half of everything you have
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.20,0:38:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.71,0:38:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则交易取消\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the deal's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.97,0:38:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.43,0:38:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.34,0:38:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.16,0:38:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易达成\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have yourself a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.51,0:38:45.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还要什么  要一个肾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want anything else? Kidney, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.44,0:38:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.96,0:38:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我的确想要一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do want something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.91,0:39:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连尼根第一次都没拿走这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Negan didn't get this much up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.45,0:39:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.99,0:39:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶稣说你从一开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said you've been
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.90,0:39:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就负责给尼根运送物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking supplies to Negan since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.25,0:39:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会救回克雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get Craig back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.58,0:39:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救回克雷格的唯一方式是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to get Craig back
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,献上格雷戈里的人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to bring them Gregory's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.16,0:39:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会救回克雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get Craig back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.06,0:39:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么救\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.98,0:39:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你提供尼根基地的情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know what you know about Negan's compound.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.38,0:39:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.42,0:39:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.44,0:39:39.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.57,0:39:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.86,0:39:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能坐下一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got room for one more, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.67,0:39:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可是要去让世界恢复正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we're talking about righting the world here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.79,0:40:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说了  我的刀还在你们那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, you still have my knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.10,0:40:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.32,0:40:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定会战斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.01,0:40:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.61,0:40:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.71,0:40:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll win.
